  "question": {
    "text": "The figure below shows the top view of a hollow cylindrical room having a frictionless floor. A block of mass&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> is projected with a speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi></math>,&nbsp;on the smooth horizontal floor, along the wall of the room. The average normal force exerted by the cylindrical walls, on the block, during its motion from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math> is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0069_cedbbaeff627.jpg\" style=\"width: 120px; height: 154px;\" />"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>π</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The change in momentum of the block from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi></math></p><p>The time it takes to move from <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mi>v</mi></mfrac></math></p><p>The average force exerted by the wall&nbsp;on the block is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>avg</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
